             </span>\n              <span className=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-medium\">Real-time Subtitle</span>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-100 font-medium leading-relaxed italic\">\n              \"{visibleText || (state === \"listening\" ? \"Listening...\" : \"Connected\")}\"\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
    }
