    thinking: "**Considering Integration Details**\n\nI\'m now carefully reviewing the instructions to build an integrated browser within Navi, specifically focusing on the environment facts. I\'m operating within a Cloud Run web container using Vite, React, and Express. The constraints are shaping the browser integration plan. I need to figure out a method, so I can start integrating it, and not start from scratch!\n\n\n**Evaluating Browser Compatibility**\n\nI\'ve realized that Electron\'s native desktop requirements are incompatible with the Cloud Run environment. However, a viable path is emerging: an embedded browser within a React iframe/webview. This approach aligns with the user\'s request for a split layout: a Navi voice assistant section and a resizable embedded browser section. I\'m focusing on features such as multiple tabs, address bar, back/forward buttons, as well as the important aspect of maintaining a usable web browser experience.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
