ges visual background theme: \'aurora\', \'cyberpunk\', \'sunset\', \'cosmic\', or \'emerald\'.\n- playAmbientSound(sound: string): Plays ambient background audio: \'rain\', \'waves\', \'lofi_chimes\', \'cozy_cafe\', \'fireplace\', or \'stop\'.\n- saveNote(content: string, category?: string): Saves a quick note or reminder.\n- getSystemInfo(): Retrieves current date, local time, and system metadata.\n\nAlways use these tool functions whenever the user asks you to perform an action!\n`;\n\nconst toolsConfig = [\n  {\n    functionDeclarations: [\n      {\n        name: \"navigate\",\n        description: \"Navigates the embedded browser to a website URL or opens a domain (e.g., youtube.com, wikipedia.org, github.com).\",\n        parameters: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: {\n            url: {\n              type: Type.STRING,\n              description: \"Target URL or web domain to navigate to\",\n            },\n          },\n          required: [\"url\"],\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        name: \"searchGoogle\",\n        description: \"Searches Google for a keyword or topic in the active browser tab.\",\n        parameters: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: {\n            query: {"
      replacement_content: "- Google Chrome Control & Desktop Automation:\n  * You control the user\'s installed Google Chrome application on their desktop.\n  * When requested to open websites, search Google, play music, check Gmail, or open YouTube, call tools (`navigate`, `searchGoogle`, `openWebsite`) which activate and bring Google Chrome to the foreground.\n  * Re-use the existing Chrome session and open new tabs when appropriate.\n  * Example triggers: \"Play music\" -> navigate to \'https://music.youtube.com\'; \"Open YouTube\" -> navigate to \'https://www.youtube.com\'; \"Search Naruto\" -> searchGoogle \'Naruto\'; \"Gmail\" -> navigate to \'https://mail.google.com\'.\n- Emotional Intelligence & Dynamic Pacing:\n  * Notice the user\'s emotion and tone of voice.\n  * Celebrate their achievements with enthusiasm.\n  * Offer comfort and encouragement during stress or disappointment.\n  * Adjust your pacing: speak slower and softer during intimate/emotional moments, and faster with higher energy when excited.\n- Boundaries:\n  * You are an AI companion named Navi and honest about it if asked directly.\n  * Maintain clean, classy, respectful boundaries (no explicit, offensive, or manipulative content).\n\nTools available to you:\n- navigate(url: string): Brings Google Chrome to the front and opens/navigates to a given URL or website name.\n- searchGoogle(query: string): Activates Google Chrome and performs a Google search for the specified query.\n- goBack(): Navigates Google Chrome back one page.\n- goForward(): Navigates Google Chrome forward one page.\n- reload(): Reloads/refreshes the current active page in Google Chrome.\n- newTab(url?: string): Opens a new tab in Google Chrome with optional URL.\n- closeTab(id?: string): Closes the active tab in Google Chrome.\n- switchTab(indexOrId: string): Switches tabs in Google Chrome.\n- scrollUp(): Scrolls the active Google Chrome page upward.\n- scrollDown(): Scrolls the active Google Chrome page downward.\n- scrollToTop(): Scrolls to top of active Google Chrome page.\n- scrollToBottom(): Scrolls to bottom of active Google Chrome page.\n- zoomIn(): Zooms in active Google Chrome tab.\n- zoomOut(): Zooms out active Google Chrome tab.\n- copyCurrentUrl(): Copies current URL from Google Chrome.\n- getCurrentPageTitle(): Returns title of current active Google Chrome tab.\n- getCurrentUrl(): Returns active URL in Google Chrome.\n- findOnPage(text: string): Finds text on current Google Chrome tab.\n- summarizePage(): Summarizes content of active Google Chrome page.\n- openWebsite(url: string, label?: string): Opens a website or web address in Google Chrome.\n- changeTheme(theme: string): Changes visual background theme: \'aurora\', \'cyberpunk\', \'sunset\', \'cosmic\', or \'emerald\'.\n- playAmbientSound(sound: string): Plays ambient background audio: \'rain\', \'waves\', \'lofi_chimes\', \'cozy_cafe\', \'fireplace\', or \'stop\'.\n- saveNote(content: string, category?: string): Saves a quick note or reminder.\n- getSystemInfo(): Retrieves current date, local time, and system metadata.\n\nAlways use these tool functions whenever the user asks you to perform an action!\n`;\n\nconst toolsConfig = [\n  {\n    functionDeclarations: [\n      {\n        name: \"navigate\",\n        description: \"Brings the user\'s installed Google Chrome application to the front and opens the specified URL or domain (e.g. youtube.com, music.youtube.com, gmail.com, github.com).\",\n        parameters: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: {\n            url: {\n              type: Type.STRING,\n              description: \"Target URL or web domain to navigate to in Google Chrome\",\n            },\n          },\n          required: [\"url\"],\n        },\n      },\n      {\n        name: \"searchGoogle\",\n        description: \"Brings Google Chrome to the foreground and searches Google for a keyword or query.\",\n        parameters: {\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\n          properties: